      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that they both have points, but you said restorative is what \"many argue\" is a more complete imperative. that sounds like you're leaning towards it. honestly, if we're talking about actual progress in modern ethics, isn't the retributive model just fundamentally outdated compared to restorative justice?",
